        "title_override": "GRUNT STYLE NEBRASKA CROSSING RETAIL STORE",
        "intro": "<p>Nebraska Crossing is a premier outdoor shopping destination in Gretna, Nebraska, off I-80 between Omaha and Lincoln. Featuring over 80 retail brands and restaurants. Located 20 miles from Offutt AFB, the home of Strategic Command. The center is supported by a strong Veteran and Patriotic community. Nebraska Crossing Outlets is the nation's most innovative technology-driven outlet shopping experience, focused on offering an elevated customer journey to deliver the best value and quality. Grunt Style Exclusives available only at this location.</p>",
